Model weights

This repository contains no model weights. Training and sampling load the Stable Diffusion 3
Medium weights (stabilityai/stable-diffusion-3-medium-diffusers) from the Hugging Face Hub. These
weights, and any weights derived from them (including student weights trained or exported with this
code), are not covered by the Apache License of this repository; they are subject to the license of
stabilityai/stable-diffusion-3-medium as stated on its model card
(https://huggingface.co/stabilityai/stable-diffusion-3-medium).

The Z-Image code in zimage/ loads the Z-Image weights (Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image at revision
04cc4abb7c5069926f75c9bfde9ef43d49423021: transformer, VAE, Qwen3 text encoder and tokenizer) from
the Hugging Face Hub. These weights, and any weights derived from them (including student weights
trained or exported with this code), are subject to the license of Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image as stated on
its model card (https://huggingface.co/Tongyi-MAI/Z-Image; the model card metadata at that
revision names apache-2.0).

Data from COCO 2017 (https://cocodataset.org) is subject to its own terms of use.
